    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey quick question. im a freelance designer and trying to clean up my quickbooks for end of year. i just bought a really expensive ergonomic office chair for my home studio like $800. do i list that as a business expense under supplies or is that more like a personal draw since it's for my house?",
