      "content": "gotcha. it just feels a bit tricky because sometimes i use the space for other stuff too. i'm also worried about small things getting lost in the shuffle, like tiny miscellaneous expenses or receipts that i might misplace. do you have any tips for making sure my books stay really organized so nothing just disappears or gets missed?",
